2. Verify install, list_schedules, remove functions exist
3. Grep for sys.platform check (darwin vs linux branching)
4. Grep for croniter.is_valid usage
5. Grep for plist XML generation (StartCalendarInterval key)
6. Verify shutil.which is used for foundry binary detection
Output PASS if all pass, FAIL with details."
    ]

    fixup_scheduler [
